{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522340/extras/5fcdc1f8f083b03ae5aab167846b4cea.avif?t=1753916030\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Drive through a series of strange worlds, racing to be the first to deliver packages to obnoxious godlike creatures who have nothing but disdain for you. At the end of each track, choose between three options for a new track - you'll decide based on your stats and the linked upgrades being offered. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522340/extras/becc567410f61f5588f9b7628e2783cb.poster.avif?t=1753916030\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522340/extras/becc567410f61f5588f9b7628e2783cb.webm?t=1753916030\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522340/extras/becc567410f61f5588f9b7628e2783cb.mp4?t=1753916030\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522340/extras/5a862090b7ccfef094febe10a376b620.avif?t=1753916030\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You'll start each race with a fixed set of stats for ACCEL, MAX SPEED and GRIP. Each time you're offered a choice for the next track, each option will be linked to a stat upgrade. Certain combinations will synergise with each other, or with your current stats! Sometimes, additional bonus upgrades such as BOOST, REGEN BRAKING, SHIELD and ANTIGRAV will be offered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some missions include roguelike deckbuilding, where you have a deck of cards which have effects while drawn. In addition to upgrading your car using the core stats, you'll also choose new cards to add to your deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522340/extras/115862b6e2d4a7ba2ad7b00c3a92c715.avif?t=1753916030\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522340/extras/5040b7b64aeba910d5ddec74734ea7cd.avif?t=1753916030\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Winning in Reality Drift is as much about making the right choices as how well you drive. Will you lean into ACCEL and MAX SPEED, or will you try to go for a GRIP build where you never have to slow down? Choices are made in real-time so you only have a few seconds to decide! The computer-controlled cars follow the same rules as you and choose which upgrades to obtain, but only you can choose what the next track will be. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522340/extras/20b80cc8734256d44191a6b51a5df5f0.poster.avif?t=1753916030\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522340/extras/20b80cc8734256d44191a6b51a5df5f0.webm?t=1753916030\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522340/extras/20b80cc8734256d44191a6b51a5df5f0.mp4?t=1753916030\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this demo you'll experience four out of the full game's 25 missions (including two with roguelike deckbuilding), meet three characters and race on eight tracks. If you can win all four missions, you'll be ready for the challenge the full game will present!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522340/extras/96308d86cd707c8010eec7b944904135.poster.avif?t=1753916030\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522340/extras/96308d86cd707c8010eec7b944904135.webm?t=1753916030\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522340/extras/96308d86cd707c8010eec7b944904135.mp4?t=1753916030\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3522340?t=1753916030","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3522340?t=1753916030","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522340/5d133e5c54a7ae6511073f81cf79076d3a8b5da1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753916030","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522340/5d133e5c54a7ae6511073f81cf79076d3a8b5da1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753916030","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522340/extras/5fcdc1f8f083b03ae5aab167846b4cea.avif?t=1753916030\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Drive through a series of strange worlds, racing to be the first to deliver packages to obnoxious godlike creatures who have 